- For each subsequent polling request, pass the query_record_id returned from the previous response. Otherwise, no search results are returned.', example='60b412-cc05-4d10-b570-'),
  searchJourneysShrink?: string(name='search_journeys', description='The search journeys.

This parameter is required.'),
  searchMode?: int32(name='search_mode', description='The search mode. Default value: 0.</br>
Valid values: OUTBOUND(0, "outbound"), INBOUND(1, "inbound").</br>
One-way: always 0. Round-trip: outbound-0, return-1. Multi-city: first leg-0, subsequent legs-1.

This parameter is required.', example='0'),
  searchPassengerListShrink?: string(name='search_passenger_list', description='The passenger information. Required if the passenger has a managed agreement price.'),
  token?: string(name='token', description='The query record token, used for external polling.

>Notice: 

- This field takes effect only when out_wheel_search is set to true.
- Do not pass a value for the first search. Otherwise, no search results are returned.
- For each subsequent polling request, pass the token returned from the previous response. Otherwise, no search results are returned.', example='9960b412-cc05-4d10-b570-93372d816807'),
  tripType?: int32(name='trip_type', description='The trip type. Default value: 1.</br>
